  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covid-19 - IFFIm for COVAX AMC 2021-2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFFIm issues vaccine bonds in the capital markets and repay these bonds with long-term donor pledges. IFFIm will frontload longterm pledges made by the Norwegian Government to the Covax AMC.</narrative>
  </description>
